tools/pipeline/ledger.json:43901:     "note": "Fable 5.1, fired LAST, verified by its own model name (claude-fable-5-1).  ACCEPT 9/9.  Floor = poisoned accept cell + interval silence + other read + survival/exit; value-keyed rows (zero, 4, all-ones, double read) clause (e) taken as L1; the DMA leg deferred to mapledmaadvance with a no-row sentence; the witness admissible, its literal `read quiet` row NOT to be inherited.  Owed: the carrier's member-5 clause gains 'nor SH, where the idiom silently skips the load' (filed -- tools/CLAUDE.md carries an earlier session's unreviewed delta)."
