tools/pipeline/ledger.json:44216:     "note": "Measuring seat, three runs in /tmp/gxopus528f (restored cmp-CLEAN).  11 mutants + 3 BASE over channel x timing x exit.  MEASURED survivors: M_EXITATQUIT / M_ABORTATQUIT 37/37 (exit status read in one session) -- repaired, REPAIR_HOW measured 36/37; M_TICKPERIODIC4 37/37 (a session spans ~3 device ticks: the first-step tick + two cpu_run_deinit() ticks) -- no finite test closes it: DISCLOSED as a window.  Caught: stderr, no-newline stdout, buffered printf at exit, tick deferrals of 1-3.  Named the shutdown-tick coupling; refuted the 'what is left' sentence a second time; withdrew its own earlier load-sensitivity claim for this version."
