5107:v2.01 (`_scratchpad/ppc_uisa_book1_v201.txt`): rlwimi `r <- ROTL32((RS)32:63, SH); m <- MASK(MB+32,
5108:ME+32); RA <- (r & m) | ((RA) & ~m)` with MASK wrapping when x > y (`:578`), and ROTL32 duplicating the
5109:word into both halves; rldimi `r <- ROTL64((RS), sh); m <- MASK(mb, 63-sh)`.
