 succeeded in 961ms:
[ledger.json:43811 paragraph-line 1] FILED 2026-09-10 from the GPT-6 Astra exit audit (regress/artifacts/queuetriage/codex_exitaudit_20260910.txt), which ranked it I1/E1. VERIFIED LOCALLY by opening the file before filing.
[ledger.json:43811 paragraph-line 2] 
[ledger.json:43811 paragraph-line 3] The read arm of `case 0x04: /* MAPLE_DMAADDR */` reads, in order:
[ledger.json:43811 paragraph-line 4]     fatal("[ dreamcast_maple: TODO: read from dmaaddr ]\n");
[ledger.json:43811 paragraph-line 5]     odata = d->dmaaddr;
